      "widgets_values": [
        "OmniCam -> MiniMax H3 API  (profile: h3_api)\n\nBase template: Comfy-Org/workflow_templates\n  api_minimax_h3_r2v.json\n\nWHAT CHANGED\nMonitor.reference_video feeds Video 1. The API path takes a VIDEO directly,\nwhere the native node wants decoded IMAGE frames - same playblast, two\ntransports, which is the whole reason h3_api and h3_native are separate\nprofiles rather than one with a switch.\n\nTHE PROMPT IS NOT WIRED\nThis node keeps its prompt as a widget, so copy Monitor.final_prompt into\nit after the first queue. It already contains the camera-motion fragment\nand the instruction to ignore the proxy's appearance. Refer to the\nreference as 'Video 1' in any text you add.\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Author the shot and click Playblast.\n2. Queue once to compile. Read the preflight.\n3. Copy final_prompt into the MiniMax node, then queue for real.\n\nREFERENCE LIMITS\nThe API accepts 23.9-60.5 fps and a 2-15s reference. Preflight checks the\nconnected playblast against those and blocks outside them, so a reference\nthe service would reject never leaves your machine.\n\nThis is an API node: it needs Comfy API credits, not local weights."
      ],
